% Fleet link-hint attribution — Tier FX FX.8.31. Replaces
% internal/linker/hints.go's ApplyHints (Tier JH).
%
% Base fact (from the "hints" hub provider, internal/factpipe/hub_hints.go —
% workspace.WorkspaceConfig.Links is fleet-wide config no `.dl` join could
% reach on its own; real rule-precedence logic, not a convention + join):
%
%   hints_patch(ID, TargetService, Path, KeyDynamic)
%       a client node's resolved target_service/path/key_dynamic. Any of
%       TargetService/Path/KeyDynamic may be "" — the hub already decided
%       which of the three won for this node, and patch:'s Meta overlay
%       skips whichever column resolves empty.
%
% Pure pass-through — the hub already resolved the winning rule (or decided
% none applied) before asserting a fact.

hints_patch_rel(ID, TargetService, Path, KeyDynamic) :-
    hints_patch(ID, TargetService, Path, KeyDynamic).
